    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cart Capers</strong>, your shopping cart is your ticket to glory! Race through chaotic obstacle courses where skill and timing can mean the difference between victory and lose. Compete against your friends or other players online as you pull off wheelies, launch daring jumps, and drift your way to the finish line. Whether you're speeding through tight racetracks or dodging deadly traps in deathrun gauntlets, one thing is certain \u2014 only the craftiest cart-rider will cross the finish line first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Controls</strong><br><br> Master unique cart physics: push off the ground to move, pop wheelies to navigate tricky obstacles, and combine them with drifts and jumps to outmaneuver the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Multiplayer Races</strong><br><br> Challenge up to 4 of your friends !<strong> </strong><br> <br> Start with beginner-friendly tracks designed to teach the basics \u2014 then take on progressively harder levels that test every trick in your cart-riding arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> Bright, energetic environments and playful designs that keep the action lively and fun from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Roll?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <strong>Cart Capers</strong> \u2014 where every corner could mean a jump, a crash, or a moment of absolute triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
